        <li class="reveal"><strong>Minimum passengers:</strong> Day safaris require 2+ pax for charter flights. Single supplement applies.</li>
        <li class="reveal"><strong>Licensing:</strong> Mainland safaris require a Tanzania mainland license (different from ZCT). We partner with fully licensed operators.</li>
